
# Implementation Plan: Nucleus Agent Runtime (NAR) Phase 2

## Goal
Implement **Dynamic Context Injection** (RAG-lite) in the Nucleus Factory.
This allows agents to automatically receive relevant documentation based on user intent, without bloating the prompt with the entire wiki.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> This changes [factory.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/factory.py) core logic. Agents will now receive a "Dynamic Context" section in their system prompt. System performance should slightly improve (less irrelevant context) but might require tuning `context_rules.json`.

## Proposed Changes

### `mcp-server-nucleus`

#### [NEW] `src/mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/context_rules.json`
- Defines the mapping between Keywords and Doc Paths.
- Start with 5-10 key rules (Deploy, Architecture, Database).

#### [MODIFY] [src/mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/factory.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/factory.py)
- Add `_resolve_dynamic_context(intent: str) -> str`.
- Update [create_context](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/factory.py#304-342) to call this resolver.
- Append output to [system_prompt](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/factory.py#393-441).

## Verification Plan

### Automated Verification
- **Unit Test**: specific test for `_resolve_dynamic_context` in `tests/test_factory_v2.py`.
- **Integration Test**: [brain_spawn_agent(intent="deploy")](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#3691-3746) -> Verify system prompt contains [cloudbuild.yaml](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/cloudbuild.yaml) content.

### Manual Verification
- Spawn a `DevOps` agent via CLI: `nucleus spawn "How do I deploy?"`
- Check if it answers using the specific [cloudbuild.yaml](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/cloudbuild.yaml) details (not generic knowledge).
